        "Performance Features",
        "It is mainly composed of solution tank, mixer, metering pump, Y‑type filter, safety valve, back‑pressure valve, check valve, pulse damper, water level gauge, pressure gauge, control cabinet and installation platform, all integrally mounted on one base. Users only need to place the combined dosing device in the dosing room, connect the dosing pipes and power supply, then it can be started and put into operation. During operation, it automatically detects the pH value of the fluid, intelligently judges and doses the corresponding chemical solution. This factory‑manufactured complete set of device can greatly reduce the workload of design and on‑site construction, basically realizing unattended operation, and providing reliable guarantee for the quality, safety and on‑site commissioning of the whole unit.",
